  "content": "# 第23题\n\n**题型**: 选择题\n\n**难度**: ★★☆☆☆\n\n**分值**: 2分\n\n---\n\n## 题目内容\n\nWhich is a requirement for the applicants?\n\n## 选项\n\nA. A. Spreading the message of sport for good.\n\nB. B. Having at least one-year work experience.\n\nC. C. Showing great passion for project planning.\n\nD. D. Committing themselves to becoming an expert.\n\n---\n\n## 参考答案\n\nB\n\n",
  "answer": "A",
  "analysis": "本题考查虚拟语气。与过去事实相反，if从句用had done，主句用would have done。句意‘如果当时带了地图，我们就不会迷路了’，故选A。"
